# Generated PKI material must never be committed (PP02).
# Only this .gitignore and README.md are tracked; everything else (CA, keys,
# service certs, per-service openssl.cnf) is produced by
# scripts/certs/generate-ca.sh + issue-certs.sh. ca-key.pem additionally
# lives in Vault, not on disk long-term.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
